  "title": "Debbie P NDE 4186/7001 NDE 7001",
  "date": "7/5/1965 | 7/15/1967",
  "content": "7001 I felt like I woke up and saw my body lying in the pool. I had a red or blue swimsuit on and I saw bubbles coming out of my nose. I was floating above my body and was asking myself why I was lying there. I heard air rushing past me and was looking at my body and wondering why I was down there. I was not afraid. It was like I was watching a movie. After a few minutes, I starting going higher and higher away to the blue and white clouds. It reminds me of looking out of an airplane. I did not fly, but was lifted. Suddenly, I felt a jolt like an electrical shock and I was awake. I tried to tell my mom years later, but she refuses to believe me.\n\nI felt like I woke up and saw my body lying in the pool. I had a red or blue swimsuit on and I saw bubbles coming out of my nose. I was floating above my body and was asking myself why I was lying there. I heard air rushing past me and was looking at my body and wondering why I was down there. I was not afraid. It was like I was watching a movie. After a few minutes, I starting going higher and higher away to the blue and white clouds. It reminds me of looking out of an airplane. I did not fly, but was lifted. Suddenly, I felt a jolt like an electrical shock and I was awake. I tried to tell my mom years later, but she refuses to believe me.",
